<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT IN OKLAHOMA CITY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT IN OKLAHOMA CITY.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Oklahoma 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on</p>
<p>Monday at the $164,250 women's tennis tournament (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>4-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Karin Kschwendt (Austria) 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Francesca Lubiani (Italy) beat 6-Amy Frazier (U.S.) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Catalina Cristea (Romania) beat Jolene Watanabe (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Rene Simpson (Canada) beat Rika Hiraki (Japan) 6-2 3-6 6-3</p>
</text>
